<!--
    FocusGuard — res/values/strings.xml
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    UX Copywriting Philosophy:
      Every string here has been written for a zero-technical-knowledge user.
      Rules followed:
        1. Never use: "ML", "model", "algorithm", "threshold", "prediction",
           "neural network", "TFLite", "inference", "package name", "API"
        2. Use plain human language: "the AI", "your habits", "distraction risk"
        3. Calm, encouraging, non-judgmental tone throughout
        4. Short sentences — max 12 words for action labels
        5. Use "you/your" to make it personal and warm
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
